<title>UK: Belgium plans $500 mln five-year Euro-Asian bond.</title>
<headline>Belgium plans $500 mln five-year Euro-Asian bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium will issue a $500 million five-year Euro-Asian bond, Morgan Stanley said as joint lead manager of the transaction on Monday.</p>
<p>UBS will be the other joint lead manager.  </p>
<p>A Euro-Asian bond has listings in both Europe and Asia to attract investors from both regions. The Belgium issue was expected to surface this week if market conditions were favourable, syndicate managers said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
